        "id": 1258954
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-04T05:07:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had to change it as otherwise dex2oatd for boot image was failing.\n\nIn this particular case it\u0027s safe because it\u0027s done in the flip-function. So the owning_thread can\u0027t become runnable until gc-thread is done running its flip-function.\n\nIs it possible to update the DCHECK as `owning_thread-\u003eIsSuspended() || owning_thread-\u003eFlipFunctionPending()` or something to that effect?",
      "parentUuid": "a7f70e93_2e0d39b4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 47,
        "endLine": 24,
        "endChar": 99
